**Context band and handover.** At about 70% context start no new step; at about 75% stop at a safe boundary (no write half-done, the worktree consistent, files whole, no process left running) and write `1_Project_Definition/Briefs/2026-11-11_B1509_HANDOVER.md` (done / in hand / next / processes left / decisions a successor keeps, every comment id, move and created key already written), last line `HANDOVER B1509: next <step> | done <steps>`, and make that the STATUS last line. A successor reads each key's comments first and never re-posts; it counts the project's issues first and never creates a second Task.

## FENCES, PARTITION, HOLDS
- **Git:** root history writes only `worktree add -b`, ONE commit, ONE `merge --no-ff`. No `worktree remove`, `fetch`, `push`, `stash`, `reset`, `rebase`, `amend`, `prune`, `gc`, `clean`. In the code repo: `gh api -X GET` only; you clone nothing and edit no file there.
- **HTTP:** `gh api -X GET` to the code repo; the Jira site named in the project's `.env` for the closed-list reads and writes only (python `-I`, token in-process, never printed). No mailbox, no demo, no hosted or production host, no container registry. No az, ssh, docker, tests, build, deploy, mail, chat, Artifact, Docs, PR, merge of any PR, card or `decision_queue.sh`; no message to any human; no comment or edit on any PR.
- **Yours:** the 5 Jira keys THE LIST holds and the one create; root `main` for the one merge; `.tools/wt-b1509-rec`, `records/b1509`; your Step-0 copy, STATUS, `Briefs/2026-11-11_B1509_evidence/`, `.tools/b1509/`. **Read-only:** the two gate files in Tuesday's `briefs/` folder, the three builder STATUS files (B1495, B1504, B1506) and their evidence, `.tools/b1489/scripts/` and `.tools/b1499/scripts/` (copy, never edit). **Not yours:** every other Jira key (PCOMP-46, 94, 83, 74, 80, 81, 11, 52, 98, 116, 127 were closed or commented by B1499; PCOMP-113, 114, 62 by earlier passes; PCOMP-28, 25 and 93 are about the demo and untouched), `2_Project_Files` code, `.tools/b1495`, `.tools/b1504`, `.tools/b1506`, every other seat's tree, open PRs #85, #86, #91.
- **Standing lines:** PRIOR-WORK CHECK (above); no message to any human; Jira writes only where THE LIST says; never delete (quarantine); never print a credential; no word added to any user-facing text; `always-verify-and-check` and `no-skip-on-failure`: a red you cannot explain is a STOP.
- **HOLDS:** no deploy and no statement about the hosted state beyond "NOT DEPLOYED" as a repository fact; no ruling of your own (the rulings are quoted; the grammar line's wording is NOT yours and not written anywhere but as "needs approved wording"); no label edit on any existing issue; no edit of `DEPLOY.md`, no fix of the stale lines (the new Task is the record of them); PCOMP-46, 94, 74, 80, 81, 11, 52, 83, 98, 116, 127 untouched; the 0022 section's form is NOT measured by you (no docker).

